            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Nvidia faces ban in China, Chinese tech gains, Uber stock falls",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks today's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute, including China's decision to ban companies from buying chips from Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>); the gains seen from Chinese online giants Baidu (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BIDU\">BIDU</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9888.HK\">9888.HK</a>), Alibaba (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BABA\">BABA</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9988.HK\">9988.HK</a>), and JD.com (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JD\">JD</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9618.HK\">9618.HK</a>); and Uber's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UBER\">UBER</a>) stock falling on headlines of Lyft's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LYFT\">LYFT</a>) partnership with Waymo.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
